OL,3,GNEWSAHow Scottish FA used AI in
OL,4,Aselecting new Scotland boss Pocognoli
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 20 people made it known to the
OL,7,FScottish FA that they wanted to be
OL,8,Fconsidered to replace Steve Clarke as
OL,9,FScotland's new head coach.
OL,11,FNot one of them was interviewed.
OL,13,FNot because they weren't capable, but
OL,14,Fbecause the computer said no.
OL,16,FThe days of board members sifting
OL,17,Fthrough applicants and picking the best
OL,18,Fare long gone thanks to football
OL,19,Fanalytics and AI.
